{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act52side_level_act52side_01_end","storyGroup":"act52side","storySort":3,"storyDependence":"act52side_level_act52side_01_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"YW-1","storyName":"互助会","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"德鲁莎怀疑技术工阿奎拉参与了非法行动，纳乔与克莱门莎为其解围。教堂内，阿奎拉的互助会导师露出真身，他正是深海主教奥卢斯。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act52side/level_act52side_01_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act52side_01_end","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":1,"next":3,"characters":["艾丽妮","斐戴拉","纳乔","克莱门莎","小帮手","好奇的技术工","路过的技术工","阿奎拉","德鲁莎","？？？","感激的岛民","“导师”","“同胞”","平和的教徒","奥卢斯"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_bg_74_g8_shipatelier.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"dialog","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"大海的气味……","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#8$1","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"打捞船不是审判庭收缴的违禁品，而是真正投入使用的载具。虽然我一直坚信这一天终将到来，但还是……难以置信。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"船厂路滑，还请您务必小心，斐戴拉大审判官。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":17},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fsmummy","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":18},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"虽然你已经辞去审判官的职务，但作为达里奥的学生，你仍是审判庭最锋利的刺剑之一。在我身边，怎么倒像是搀扶老人的拐杖了？","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"我绝无轻视您的意思！","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"只是您自……老师牺牲之后，主动参加了几乎每一场海嗣剿灭行动。也正是因为那些战斗留下的沉疴，圣徒阁下才将您调至船厂。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"被海风侵蚀的伤口总是好得慢一些，不是什么大事。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"至于达里奥……圣徒阁下让我辨认达里奥遗体的时候，我只看到了一把不知是人还是海嗣的骨头烧成的灰。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"但我知道他是为了伊比利亚的明天而死，他的名字刻在海风一时半刻吃不掉的地方，这就够了。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"放轻松点吧，艾丽妮。雷亚-伊比利亚是个不同的地方，我们即将在这里见证伊比利亚摆脱它的沉疴。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"若能如此，远离地牢，远离跟岛民们算不清的旧账，我们就在船厂作伴又有什么不好呢？","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"您说得没错。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"只是我原以为圣徒阁下会将您调派至巡逻组。让一名曾抗击暴风与邪祟的大审判官负责管理打捞沉船残骸的船厂，实在有些……","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"打捞残骸，修补船只，确实不是大审判官的职责。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"但在被我们用来焚烧海嗣之前，提灯首先是照亮海雾的工具。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"如果港都要成为连通陆地与海洋的港口，那么伊比利亚人需要重新学会造船、出海。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"您和卡门阁下说的几乎一模一样。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"我毕竟是他的学生，这些年来，我从他身上学到的不只有杀死海嗣的技巧。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"然而有些东西，哪怕我在他身边再久，都无法学到……","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"斐戴拉大审判官？","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/80/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"没什么。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"在迷雾中航行太久的船总需要喘口气，正好，这里就是修补它的地方。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"我会遵从圣徒阁下的意愿，在这里好好休养。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":52},{"type":"dialog","id":53},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":54},{"type":"charslot","id":55},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":56},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_bg_74_g12_underseahall_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":57},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":58},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":59},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":60,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1","duration":"1","id":62},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"这里就是水下观测厅，用于操作支撑外围城区和中心城区的起重机。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"技术工的工作，就是连接灯塔与起重机的能源管路，让三十七座灯塔为起重机供能，实现之后的打捞计划。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"……","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"克莱门莎监事，您一直盯着窗外，是在担心水下作业的情况吗？","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"唔……现在正在工作的是二组的技术工对吗？棕头发的是索莱达，动作最麻利的是马修。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"看来就算没有我介绍，您对打捞组也已经足够了解了。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"只是记住几个名字，算不上了解。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"在军团服役时，我用来记住每一个士兵名字的方法，是将航路上的坐标跟人一一对应。数字的组合是独一无二的，每一个人也是如此。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"这个方法听上去更复杂了……","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"记忆和了解完全不同。我相信只有切实交流之后，冰冷的信息才会变成一种感受，让你了解一个人、一片土地。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"multiline","name":"克莱门莎","text":"不过在找到合适的机会之前，所有的信息和知识只能暂且存放在我的脑子里，比如——","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":83},{"type":"multiline","name":"克莱门莎","text":"鲁菲纳。","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"！","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"她是你的奶奶对吗？她曾经参与港都的建设，是位优秀的工人，我为你失去她而感到抱歉。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"您真的记得……不用抱歉，自奶奶病重去世已经过了十年，我也习惯独自一人生活了。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"我的假肢就是她做的，是它让我觉得奶奶一直在陪着我，可现在……","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"shake","power":"7","times":"5","duration":"0.3","id":93},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"嗯？什么东西在撞我的腿？","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":97},{"type":"charslot","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1401_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":99},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":100},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_microrobot","volume":"1","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小帮手","text":"发现故障，发现故障。","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_1401_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小帮手","text":"肢体模块磨损严重。为了我们更好的明天，请使用者严格遵守八小时工作制。","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_1401_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小帮手","text":"——监测到患者疼痛等级接近忍耐极限，需立刻移除肢体模块。准备进行手术。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_1401_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":105},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_atk_saw_n_2","volume":"1","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","power":"5","times":"150","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":107},{"type":"dialog","id":108},{"type":"charslot","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"等、等等——","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":112},{"type":"charslot","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1401_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"别激动，小帮手。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"all","id":118},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_atk_saw_n_1","volume":"1","id":119},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":121},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"欸……您……徒手卸下了它的旋转刀头吗？","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"这台小帮手上装的是战时医疗模块，强制打断它的动作会比语音指令更快一些。抱歉，擅自扫描了你的生命体征和假肢使用情况。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"我想，大概是因为前几天我在水下作业时，弄丢了假肢上的一枚螺栓，所以小机器人才报错的。","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"你愿意让我检查一下吗？我会比小帮手礼貌一些。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1401_1#1$1","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小帮手","text":"……","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_1401_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":135},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"好的。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"令人惊叹。假肢上用的所有零件都再普通不过，但它别出心裁的架构方式似乎完美适配了你的需求。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"不过锈蚀还是太严重了，连接处的伤口情况也比我想象的更糟，上面还有烧伤的瘢痕。你是一直忍着疼痛在工作？","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"因为痛是可以忍的。至于烧伤……来自十几年前扔进我房间的一枚燃烧瓶。我活着逃了出来，但手还是没保住。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"惨重的意外。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"是啊，那是我第一次见到奶奶露出那么伤心的表情。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"她是个坚韧严格的长辈，哪怕我的同龄人早早就去开垦盐碱地或者捕鳞了，她也依然执着地要求我学习阿戈尔语和工程设计。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"难怪，你的阿戈尔语说得非常标准。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"要是让她知道我刻意忽视她的提醒，戴着假肢下水，还弄丢了她的零件，不知道她会多生气……","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"掉入茫茫大海中的一颗螺栓，想必也是找不回来了。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"哪怕是一颗螺栓，掉入海中时也会掀起波澜，未必找不回来。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"不过，当务之急是要处理假肢的问题。你希望继续完成水下作业，亲手打捞港都中心城区？","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"是的，这对我来说很重要。","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"好，我可以让小帮手打印一只更适配你现在工作需要的假肢。设计需要花费一些时间，但至少它会让你工作时不必为疼痛分心。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"谢谢您，克莱门莎监事。","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":165},{"type":"charslot","id":166},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":167},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":168},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":169},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好奇的技术工","text":"发生了什么？","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的技术工","text":"有个穿着惩戒军制服的人正在打捞中心乱晃。","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好奇的技术工","text":"查案？","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的技术工","text":"看着不像，她好像在跟阿奎拉确认签到日志的问题。","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好奇的技术工","text":"又是刻意刁难？我以为至少在这里不会碰到这种事。","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的技术工","text":"不好说啊，不过那个惩戒军好像也是个岛民。","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"阿奎拉……？","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"……","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":182},{"type":"dialog","id":183},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":184},{"type":"charslot","id":185},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#4$1","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#2$1","id":188},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_bg_74_g10_underseacorr.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":189},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":190},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":191,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"长官，不是例行证件检查吗，还没结束？","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":194},{"type":"multiline","name":"德鲁莎","text":"哎呀，实在抱歉，阿奎拉小姐是吧？你确认一下这里的进出记录就好……","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":196},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_pendrop","volume":"1","id":197},{"type":"multiline","name":"德鲁莎","text":"啊！","id":198},{"type":"dialog","id":199},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-70","duration":"0.5","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":201},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,-70","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.8","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#4$1","id":203},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"笔拿稳了。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"多谢你，好心的同胞。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"我从未听说惩戒军的队伍里有岛民。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"严格来说我不能算审判庭的人，不过是个连队伍番号都没有的小角色罢了。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"他们应当重视我们。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"要是他们再重视我一点，可就要多给我派活了，训练新兵已经让我苦不堪言咯。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"你是惩戒军教官……","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"紧张是对的。刚刚你弯腰捡笔的时候，我确认了你背后的气瓶管少了一根，而我正好在远离观测厅的海岸捡到了一根类似的。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"启动仪式当天，你应当早早完成了当时班次的任务，但你的装备却落在了非工作区域，解释一下你去了哪里？","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"我——","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"她去帮我拿药了。","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"纳乔？克莱门莎监事？","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":229},{"type":"charslot","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1","duration":"0.5","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","duration":"0.5","id":232},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"长、长官，您也看见我这只手了，那天是我的假肢需要维护的日子。","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"阿奎拉关心每一位同胞，她总是主动帮我买防水涂料和生物阻隔剂，没有错过一次。她、她或许还留着那天的收据。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":237},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#5$1","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"……","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#2$1","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"哎呀，看来是我误会了。不过——","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"抱歉，女士。我再三查阅记录，怎么都找不到审判庭的调查通知。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#2$1","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"这位是克莱门莎监事吧？请不要见怪，这算不上调查。我本来也没想打扰各位伟大的打捞工作，奈何这身制服实在太扎眼了。","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"惩戒军一般驻守在打捞中心外的岗哨，记录技术工的进出和行动。知晓一切的眼睛，想必不需要怀疑自己看到了什么。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#2$1","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"当然，这只是一次心血来潮的拜访，我还从来没有亲眼见过来自深海的同胞呢。","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"我想，我们的耳朵都是尖的。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#2$1","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"哈哈，当然。在弥利亚留姆，您一定是一位很得民心的执政官……","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"可惜，这里是伊比利亚。","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"……","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"先告辞了。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":260},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":262},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":263},{"type":"charslot","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"……","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"阿奎拉。","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"克莱门莎监事，那个惩戒军所指控的一切，我毫不知情。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"不用向我解释，阿奎拉。那位惩戒军有一点说得没错，这里是伊比利亚，如果我无法亲自核实她的判断，那我暂且不会多言。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"……","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"来到打捞中心的两天里，我跟技术工们聊了聊，他们中的大部分人非常信任你。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"我只是做了应该做的事，我会为他们解决身为岛民不得不面对的问题。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"以什么方式？","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"任何方式。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"我以为你会直接告诉我，你加入了一个互助会。","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"有人告诉你了……但帮助同胞并不违反审判庭的戒律。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"当然，我只是想知道我是否能参加。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#4$1","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"你也遇到了困难？","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"我希望解决你们的困难。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#4$1","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"……导师说过，我们是面向所有阿戈尔人的互助会，它会向每一位疑惑、困苦、向往和平的阿戈尔人敞开大门。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"但我认为，克莱门莎监事和我们——岛民们，除了样貌之外并没有共通点，恐怕不会受到欢迎。","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"我明白了。","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":298},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_higheldshosfts","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1.2","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":300},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":301},{"type":"charslot","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#8$1","duration":"0.5","id":303},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":304},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"……","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"想问就开口。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"我……","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"你怕你问出自己心里最坏的答案？那你刚刚就不该为我做伪证。","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"阿奎拉，你也看到了，克莱门莎监事显然发现了什么，但她还是帮你说话了。","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"只要港都中心城区打捞成功，我们的生活就会好起来，你——","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"你以前就是这样，总以为只要自己做得够好，经文背得够勤快，就能消除偏见。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"被鲁菲纳奶奶的事牵连的时候你什么都不说，现在你明明不想让我再去互助会还是一句话都不说。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"阿奎拉……","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"但是，刚刚你也确实在惩戒军和克莱门莎监事面前替我隐瞒，对你来说已经很不容易了。","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"纳乔，无论你是否认同我的想法，作为朋友我只托付你一件事。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"万一之后几天我出了什么事，你可以去互助会所在的教堂找我们的导师，他会帮我。","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"在此之前做你最擅长的事，什么都不要问也不要说。","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"我从不过问你做的事，阿奎拉，我只是不希望又有一个我熟悉的人陷入危险。","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"跟我的奶奶鲁菲纳一样。","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"……","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":333},{"type":"dialog","id":334},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":335},{"type":"charslot","id":336},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":337},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_bg_74_g14_ibchurch_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":338},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":339},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":340},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":341,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2272_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":342},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感激的岛民","text":"谢谢……谢谢您……导师，我知道该怎么做了。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2272_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":345},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_941_1#1$1","duration":"1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.6","id":346},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":347},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“导师”","text":"去吧，同胞。","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“导师”","text":"放下仇恨，你会迎来内心真正的平静，如果它又起波澜，我仍会在这里倾听。","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":351},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":352},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":353},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":354},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2272_1#1$1","duration":"1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.6","id":355},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“导师”","text":"抱歉，这位同胞，迷惘的人太多，我想尽可能帮助他们，但我能力有限。","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2272_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"l","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“同胞”","text":"……","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2272_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“导师”","text":"不过现在，你应该也能理解和平为何可贵，纷争为何愚蠢。","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2272_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“导师”","text":"对你而言，在教堂里活动确实不太方便，我会撤掉这层伪装……我们的实验进行到哪里了？","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2272_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"l","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“同胞”","text":"……","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2272_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":366},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_bg_74_g7_alsatelier.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","id":367},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":368},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1388_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","bstart":"0.5","bend":"0.8","id":369},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":370},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_941_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":371},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":372},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“导师”","text":"唔，我的同胞，你无需对这些炼金仪器感到好奇，它们只是另一次实验的残影，我的回忆。","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“导师”","text":"回归大群？不，你还需要陪伴我一段日子。","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“导师”","text":"哺育子代、呈递信息、同化异类……都已不是你的职责。实验很顺利，你已证明自己可以抑制本能。","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“导师”","text":"下一步，我只需将实验缸里的鳞，换成——","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":378},{"type":"charslot","id":379},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":380},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":381},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":382},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_453_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":383},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"平和的教徒","text":"抱歉打扰您，奥卢斯主教……","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_453_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#1$1","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"不打扰，我很高兴与你分享我的实验，它是我们共同畅想的未来的一环。","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"另外，暂时忘了“主教”那个称呼吧。","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"我们是同行者，没有贵贱之分，只是在当下我比你理解、掌握的知识多一点点，所以暂且充当更重要的角色。","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"你从打捞中心来……我的布置没有奏效？","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_453_1#1$1","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"平和的教徒","text":"不，如您所料，我们的同胞确实遇到了麻烦，但在我们插手之前，问题已经解决了。","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_453_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"平和的教徒","text":"一个年轻的阿戈尔人替她打了掩护，他对我们的计划一无所知。","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_453_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#7$1","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"哦？","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"同胞，请告诉我，那是一个怎样的人？","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":397},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":398},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":399},{"type":"bgeffect","id":400},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":401},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":402},{"type":"image","id":403},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":404}],"characters":["艾丽妮","斐戴拉","纳乔","克莱门莎","小帮手","好奇的技术工","路过的技术工","阿奎拉","德鲁莎","？？？","感激的岛民","“导师”","“同胞”","平和的教徒","奥卢斯"]}